.发电机卡片格式
.GEN BusName Kv   ID Model Type Xdpp  Xqpp  Td0pp  Tq0pp Emws    P   Q MVABaseRa    Xd'   Xq'   Xd    Xq  Td0' Tq0'XL    SG10  SG12   D  MVARatg,PF ,Owner
