.GEN BusName Kv   ID Model TJ Pper Qper  MVABASE  Xpp  TEQ TIP    IPMAX   PN    N 
.EXC card
.EXC BusName KV  ID _FA_ RC   XC    TR    VIMAX VIMIN TB    TC    KA    TA    VRMAX VRMIN KE    TE   SE1  SE2    EFDmin EFD1   KF   TF     KC   KD    KB    KL    KH    VLR(KR)
.EXC BusName KV  ID _FD_ RC   XC    TR    VIMAX VIMIN TB    TC    KA    TA    VRMAX VRMIN KE    TE   KI   KP     EFDmin Emax   KF   TF     KC   KD    KB    KL    KH    VLR(KR)
.EXC BusName KV  ID _FE_ RC   XC    TR    VIMAX VIMIN TB    TC    KV    TRH   VRMAX VRMIN KE    TE   SE1  SE2    EFDmin EFD1   KF   TF     KC   KD    KB    KL    KH    VLR(KR)
.EXC BusName KV  ID _FF_ RC   XC    TR    VAMAX VAMIN TB    TC    KA    TA    VRMAX VRMIN KE    TE   SE1  SE2    EFDmin EFD1   KF   TF     KC   KD    KB    KL    KH    VLR(KR)
.EXC BusName KV  ID _FH_ RC   XC    TR    VIMAX VIMIN TB    TC    KA    TA    VAMAX VAMIN KE    TE   SE1  SE2    EFDmin EFD1   KF   TF     KC   KD    VLV   KLV   KN    KR
.EXC BusName KV  ID _FM_ RC   XC    TR    K    KV   T1    T2    T3    T4    KA    TA     KF    TF  KH   VAMAX VAMIN KB   T5   KE    TE   SE1  SE2 VRMax VRmin KC  KD    KL1  VL1R EFDmax 
.EXC                 'FX' RC   XC   TR   KA   TA   KP   KI   VRMAX VRMIN IKP  IKI   VFMAX VFMIN KT  TT  KIFD TIFD EFDmin EFDMAX
