.两端直流系统的卡片格式
.直流系统主数据(整理和逆变各一张，也可以合为一张)
.HVDC2 BUSNAME BASEKV CO HZ FL TC   TVs   TVl   TDelay Valve  TD     T1   T2    T3    Ka  Mode MSU IMargin Alphastop
HVDC2 RECBUSD  113.   CO 0  0  0.    .09   .09   0.2    100.   .05   .03   4.6   .012  249.  0  0 0.     100.  
.直流系统的VDCOL(整理和逆变各一张，也可以合为一张)
.HVDC2 BUSNAME BASEKV VD V1     V2       VLow  VHigh  ILimit  IMax TVDCOL
HVDC2 RECBUSD  113.   VD -.10  -.10      .0    .70    0.1     1.2  0.00
.直流系统的故障处理(一条直流线路一张)
.HVDC2 BUSNAME BASEKV BUSNAME BASEKV FL   VStop   VBlock   VRecovery   Gmin  IOrderL  IOrderH  TBypassP  TBypassA  TBlockP  TBlockA  TRecovP  TIOrderF  TIOrderS    VDCNormal  IDCNormal
HVDC2  BUS1D   113.   BUS2D   113.   FL   0.4     0.6      0.8         7.    0.3      0.6      0.0       0.02       0.6      1.0      0.02     0.02      0.1         0.8        0.9
.直流系统调制
.HVDC2 BUSNAME BASEKV LM   Td  Tf  Te   A   B   C   D   Kl  Pmin  Pmax  Mode BUSNAME BASEKV BUSNAME BASEKV
.HVDC2 BUSNAME BASEKV HM   Td  Tf  Te   A   B   C   D   Kh  Pmin  Pmax  Mode BUSNAME BASEKV BUSNAME BASEKV
.HVDC2 BUSNAME BASEKV DF   Td  Tf  Te   A   B   C   D   Kd  Pmin  Pmax       BUSNAME BASEKV BUSNAME BASEKV
.HVDC2     'DM' ModelName MD Tvp IMAX IMIN TidMes KpI TiI MaxI MinI TGMes KpG TiGam MaxG MinG TvpS D dbg TvdclX1  Y1   X2  Y2   K1  K2  DownSpeedLimit UpSpeedLimit  γmin   Imargin  Deltγmin
.DCON    'DN' ModelName  MDTvp IMAX IMIN   P_I  T_I P_U  T_U P_Gm T_Gm VacLo TVL IdLo TIdL Tl Tp Iovl Tim Tm D Dbg Tvdcl X1 Y1   X2   Y2   K1     K2 DownSpL UpSpL αstop γmin TvpSmall
